        "title": "Reply to Conversation",
        "description": "Reply to an Intercom conversation as an admin (comment or note) via POST /conversations/{id}/reply. EffectPolicy Idempotent projects conversation id from the primary response and observes via conversations.get (handler returns raw Conversation).",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
